 its contents
{c:a \hphantom{{xyz}} b} | {eq:a \hphantom{{xyz}} b} | blank as wide as its
 contents
{c:x\vphantom{{\frac{{1}}{{2}}}}} | {eq:x\vphantom{{\frac{{1}}{{2}}}}} | blank
 as high as its contents
{c:\mathstrut} | {eq:\mathstrut} | blank as high as a bracket
{c:a~b} | {eq:a~b} | tie: a space of the text font
