 operator
{c:a\mathrel{{R}}b} | {eq:a\mathrel{{R}}b} | set a letter as a relation
{c:\mathop{{\mathrm{{Res}}}}_{{z=0}}} | {eq:\mathop{{\mathrm{{Res}}}}_{{z=0}}}
 | set a word as an operator with limits
{c:\mathopen{{[}}\mathclose{{]}}} | {eq:\mathopen{{[}}\mathclose{{]}}} | open
