 \end{{smallmatrix}}\right)} | small matrix with delimiters
{c:\begin{{pmatrix}} 1 & \cdots & 0 \\ \vdots & \ddots & \vdots \\ 0 & \cdots
 & 1 \end{{pmatrix}}} | {eq:\displaystyle \begin{{pmatrix}} 1 & \cdots & 0 \\
 \vdots & \ddots & \vdots \\ 0 & \cdots & 1 \end{{pmatrix}}} | matrix with
 dots
{c:\begin{{array}}{{ccc}} a & b & c \\ d & e & f \end{{array}}} |
 {eq:\displaystyle \begin{{array}}{{ccc}} a & b & c \\ d & e & f
 \end{{array}}} | array: a letter per column, c l or r
{c:\begin{{array}}{{lr}} x & 1 \\ yy & 22 \end{{array}}} | {eq:\displaystyle
 \begin{{array}}{{lr}} x & 1 \\ yy & 22 \end{{array}}} | left and right
 aligned columns
{c:\begin{{array}}{{c|c}} a & b \\ \hline c & d \end{{array}}} |
 {eq:\displaystyle \begin{{array}}{{c|c}} a & b \\ \hline c & d \end{{array}}}
 | rules between columns and rows
{c:\left(\begin{{array}}{{cc|c}} 1 & 0 & 2 \\ 0 & 1 & 3 \end{{array}}\right)}
 | {eq:\displaystyle \left(\begin{{array}}{{cc|c}} 1 & 0 & 2 \\ 0 & 1 & 3
 \end{{array}}\right)} | augmented matrix
{c:\begin{{cases}} x & x\ge 0 \\ -x & x<0 \end{{cases}}} | {eq:\displaystyle
 \begin{{cases}} x & x\ge 0 \\ -x & x<0 \end{{cases}}} | cases
{c:|x|=\begin{{cases}} x & \text{{if }} x\ge 0 \\ -x & \text{{if }} x<0
 \end{{cases}}} | {eq:\displaystyle |x|=\begin{{cases}} x & \text{{if }} x\ge
 0 \\ -x & \text{{if }} x<0 \end{{cases}}} | function by cases
{c:\begin{{aligned}} a &= b+c \\ &= d \end{{aligned}}} | {eq:\displaystyle
 \begin{{aligned}} a &= b+c \\ &= d \end{{aligned}}} | lines aligned at the
 sign &
{c:\begin{{aligned}} x &= 1 & y &= 2 \\ z &= 3 & w &= 4 \end{{aligned}}} |
 {eq:\displaystyle \begin{{aligned}} x &= 1 & y &= 2 \\ z &= 3 & w &= 4
 \end{{aligned}}} | two pairs of columns
{c:\begin{{gathered}} a=b \\ c=d \end{{gathered}}} | {eq:\displaystyle
 \begin{{gathered}} a=b \\ c=d \end{{gathered}}} | lines centered
{c:\begin{{matrix}}a\\b\end{{matrix}}} | {eq:\displaystyle
 \begin{{matrix}}a\\b\end{{matrix}}} | rows separated by two backslashes
{c:\substack{{i<n\\ j<m}}} | {eq:\displaystyle \substack{{i<n\\ j<m}}} |
 stacked lines under a limit
{c:\begin{{subarray}}{{l}} i<n \\ j<m \end{{subarray}}} | {eq:\displaystyle
 \begin{{subarray}}{{l}} i<n \\ j<m \end{{subarray}}} | stacked lines, left
 aligned
{c:\begin{{pmatrix}} \begin{{matrix}} 1 & 0 \\ 0 & 1\end{{matrix}} & 0 \\ 0 &
 2 \end{{pmatrix}}} | {eq:\displaystyle \begin{{pmatrix}} \begin{{matrix}} 1 &
 0 \\ 0 & 1\end{{matrix}} & 0 \\ 0 & 2 \end{{pmatrix}}} | matrix of matrices
.end

The environments of amsmath that make a whole displayed formula with its own
number (equation, align, gather, multline, eqnarray) are not allowed: the
equation is already displayed by Strata and is not numbered.  The command
{c:\tag} makes TeX stop with an error.
